## What is PLM Software?  

**PLM software** is a digital solution that enables companies to manage the entire lifecycle of a product, from concept to disposal. It integrates data, processes, and teams, ensuring a seamless flow of information across departments. With **PLM solutions**, businesses can eliminate data silos, reduce errors, and speed up time-to-market.  

